## Room to settle in

Designed around comfort and convenience, the Studio has everything you need to feel at home: a comfortable double bed, a spacious bathroom with a walk-in shower, and a fully equipped kitchenette with a Nespresso machine. A cosy, practical base for short and long stays alike.
